<title>UK: SOCCER-MIDDLESBROUGH 2 CHESTERFIELD 2 - LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MIDDLESBROUGH 2 CHESTERFIELD 2 - LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chesterfield and Middlesbrough</p>
<p>were drawing 2-2 in their English F.A. Cup semifinal match at</p>
<p>Old Trafford on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Chesterfield - Andy Morris 54, Sean Dyche 60 pen</p>
<p>Middlesbrough - Fabrizio Ravanelli 64, Craig Hignett 70 pen</p>
</text>
